<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>com.warlordsoftwares.twigpad</id>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>GPL-3.0-or-later</project_license>
  <name>Twigpad</name>
  <summary>Organize notes, ideas and knowledge in a tree</summary>
  <developer id="com.warlordsoftwares">
    <name>Rishabh Bhardwaj</name>
  </developer>

  <description>
    <p>
      Twigpad is a fast, simple hierarchical notes editor. Notes are kept in a
      tree on the left; the text of the selected note is on the right. It is a
      notebook, outliner and personal knowledge base in one small window, and
      everything is stored in a single plain-text file.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Unlimited nesting: add, move, sort and drag notes anywhere in the tree</li>
      <li>Find and replace across all note titles and text at once</li>
      <li>Cut, copy and paste whole branches, also between windows</li>
      <li>Opens and saves .hjt tree notes files, including backup copies and damaged files</li>
      <li>Merge several files or backups into one</li>
      <li>Export to plain text and print</li>
      <li>Backup copy on save and optional auto-save</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

